atar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/278500?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/8","html_url":"https://github.com/8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-08-08T07:24:11Z","updated_at":"2021-08-08T07:24:11Z","body":"While waiting for the next release, I fixed it locally for me by moving the two lines with `// @ts-expect-error` one line down, so that the end result looks like:\r\n\r\n```ts\r\n/**\r\n * Get an instance of `WebviewWindow` for the current webview window.\r\n *\r\n * @return The current WebviewWindow.\r\n */\r\nfunction getCurrent(): WebviewWindow {\r\n  return new WebviewWindow(window.__TAURI__.__currentWindow.label, {\r\n    // @ts-expect-error\r\n    skip: true\r\n  })\r\n}\r\n\r\n/**\r\n * Gets an instance of `WebviewWindow` for all available webview windows.\r\n *\r\n * @return The list of WebviewWindow.\r\n */\r\nfunction getAll(): WebviewWindow[] {\r\n  return window.__TAURI__.__windows.map(\r\n    // @ts-expect-error\r\n    (w) => new WebviewWindow(w, { skip: true })\r\n  )\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nTake care,\r\nMartin","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/comments/894755730/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"8","i